eme that  Obamacare get repealed or do you think  that's actually a possibility regardless  of the windows well Obamacare either  needs to be repealed or it needs to be  hugely altered one way or the other we  need to move from this top-down  regulatory approach to healthcare to one  that liberates doctors patients and  other people in the system that's great  well thank you very much for joining us  John Goodman the again the name of the  book is priceless during the health care  crisis for recent TV I mountains  you

